OL,3,GNEWSAParty plan for reopening of
OL,4,A195-year-old bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II listed bridge has reopened
OL,7,Fafter being shut for seven years, with
OL,8,Fmore than 100 residents and a brass
OL,9,Fband celebrating the return of the
OL,10,Flandmark.
OL,12,FThe 195-year-old Whorlton suspension
OL,13,Fbridge across the River Tees in County
OL,14,FDurham was painstakingly dismantled
OL,15,Fpiece by piece to allow its ironwork,
OL,16,Fdeck and suspension components to be
OL,17,Frestored.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
