OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParty plan for reopening of
OL,4,A195-year-old bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts closure meant residents faced a
OL,7,Fseven-mile (11.3km) diversion to get to
OL,8,Fthe other side of the river, although
OL,9,Fsome admitted they enjoyed the peace
OL,10,Fand would have to get used to using the
OL,11,Fpavements again.
OL,13,FMary Stastny, chair of Whorlton Village
OL,14,FCommunity Association, said: "We're
OL,15,Fhoping to reconcile the two sides at a
OL,16,Fparty tonight."
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
